     "value": "<p class=\" p2\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><br></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Un allié incontournable pour les </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.spiceevents.fr/mariages\" data-type=\"undefined\" target=\"_self\"><u><strong>mariages</strong></u></a></span></p>",
